    },
    "**Keyframes.** Start on a shared keyframe and align keyframes at least every half second. Use closed GOPs with B-frames turned off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**关键帧**：两段视频的首帧都必须是独立关键帧，且之后至少每隔半秒对齐一次独立关键帧。导出时请使用封闭式 GOP 并关闭 B 帧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Picture.** Match the resolution, orientation, codec settings, and color profile (SDR, HLG, or PQ).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**画面**：两段视频的分辨率、方向、编码设置和色彩配置（SDR、HLG 或 PQ）需要一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Timing.** Use one full-length, untrimmed video track in each file. Match the constant frame rate, frame count, and duration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**时间线**：每个文件只能包含一条完整、未裁剪的视频轨道；两段视频的恒定帧率、总帧数和时长也必须相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 pair · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 对 · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
